							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php#1">MASS LINE FORUMS</a> / <a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?board=2.0">The Dialogue</a> / <a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3386.msg38305#msg38305">vadim's blog</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: October 07, 2007, 10:42:59 pm
							</td>
